flowchart LR
    Client["Client\nSends HTTPS question"] --> APIGW["Amazon API Gateway\nPOST /ask and GET /health"]
    APIGW --> Lambda["AWS Lambda\nFastAPI plus Mangum"]
    Lambda --> Adapter["Model adapter\nStable provider interface"]
    Adapter --> Stub["Stub provider\nImplemented in TM1"]
    Adapter -. future .-> Model["Bedrock or external model\nFuture provider"]
    Lambda --> CW["Amazon CloudWatch\nLogs and metrics"]
    Lambda -. future .-> S3["Amazon S3\nFuture approved sources"]
    IAM["AWS IAM\nLeast-privilege roles"] -. authorizes .-> Lambda
    Secrets["Secrets Manager or Parameter Store\nFuture external credentials"] -. future .-> Adapter

